{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>With the mirrors of the hosts.</b> These were not included in the copper of the wave-offering, as explained in the section Pekudei (Exodus 38:30), where it says וַיַּעַשׂ בָּהּ — and he did not mention the laver and its base among the things made from it." "<b>Who served at the entrance of the tent of meeting.</b> To hear the words of the living Elohim, as it says (Exodus 33:7): וְהָיָה כָּל מְבַקֵּשׁ ה' יֵצֵא אֶל אֹהֶל מוֹעֵד. And those women rejected their ornaments and consecrated their mirrors, to make known that they no longer had need of them."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:21.198098072Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}